+        <p class="eyebrow">Now available · Volume I · Chapter 01</p>
+        <h2>Hello Agentic Coding</h2>
+        <p class="chapter-feature__dek">Learn the one-dimension shift from AI coding to agentic coding, memorize the Core Four, reproduce the branch → write → run → commit → report workflow, and make the agent callable from code.</p>
+        <ul class="chapter-feature__meta"><li>Tactic #1 · Stop Coding</li><li>45–75 min lab</li><li>12 course frames</li><li>3 current-practice overlays</li></ul>
