The final reviews now pass. I also corrected the source-of-truth nuance the review caught: the minimal Shell wrapper returns text but masks Claude’s failing exit status after `echo`, while Python explicitly propagates it and Bun maps command errors to status 1. The hub and both README status tables are now consistent with one completed chapter.
